1
00:00:00,047 --> 00:00:03,352
Kutukan Mesir kuno ditemukan
di tempat sampah kuil...

2
00:00:03,352 --> 00:00:05,556
tapi sasarannya bukan manusia,

3
00:00:05,556 --> 00:00:07,476
melainkan ular raksasa!

4
00:00:07,476 --> 00:00:10,905
Ular ini dipercaya tiap malam
menghadang dewa matahari.

5
00:00:10,905 --> 00:00:12,203
Gambarnya ditusuk,

6
00:00:12,203 --> 00:00:13,044
diinjak,

7
00:00:13,044 --> 00:00:13,842
diludahi,

8
00:00:13,842 --> 00:00:15,094
lalu dibakar.

9
00:00:15,094 --> 00:00:17,185
Kini muncul 40 serpihannya,

10
00:00:17,185 --> 00:00:19,765
1.000 tahun lebih tua
dari catatan yang dikenal!

11
00:00:19,765 --> 00:00:21,064
Nama ular itu,

12
00:00:21,064 --> 00:00:22,027
Apophis...

13
00:00:22,027 --> 00:00:23,814
dan tahun 2029,

14
00:00:23,814 --> 00:00:27,185
asteroid Apophis lewat lebih
dekat dari banyak satelit!

15
00:00:27,185 --> 00:00:27,750
Follow,

16
00:00:27,750 --> 00:00:29,982
besok ada yang lebih aneh.
